leted <kind>\", \"an ended drop box\"), else its generic word, never the address: \"#channel\", \"#group\", \"an event\", \"a proposal\", \"a to-do\", \"a message\", \"someone\", \"a drop box\" (an event's chat id ev-/ws- = \"an event\", prop- = \"a proposal\"). A box at the end follows the text after one space.",
